   Some handbook content may incorporate third-party material that carries
   separate terms. Check the upstream file and LICENSE before redistribution.

2. GitLab product documentation
   Source: https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab
   Commit: 62815568f76adcf6afd36543a8cb83eafd28d937
   Paths: doc/user, doc/administration, doc/api, doc/ci, doc/security,
          doc/topics, doc/auth, doc/install, doc/operations,
          doc/subscriptions, doc/tutorials
   License: CC BY-SA 4.0 (all content under doc/ per upstream LICENSE)
