   License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

If you redistribute the corpus or derived text, keep this notice and attribute
GitLab. The pinned commits make the snapshot reproducible; if you refresh the
corpus, update this file and data/manifest.json together.
